ator with satisfying gameplay and endless progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0Grab your mop and start your journey to the top!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Digital Melody"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937230/8deef6f201e7d7120faee3bead39f42e870239f5/header.jpg?t=1774343793","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mac OS X 10+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  2.0 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel UHD Graphics 630 1536 MB<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 12 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mac OS X 10+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.4 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Pixel Shader 3.0<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 15 GB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3937230/1473389649/a26f404b7840cd8ac30c6a4e429675c367e89c99/1755861148/dash_av1.mpd?t=1756374199","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3937230/1473389649/a26f404b7840cd8ac30c6a4e429675c367e89c99/1755861148/dash_h264.mpd?t=1756374199","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3937230/1473389649/a26f404b7840cd8ac30c6a4e429675c367e89c99/1755861148/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1756374199","id":257187159,"name":"House Cleaner Simulator Trailer 1","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/25